        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sLdT72pNXIufgefm2ZWe-13" parent="1" style="shape=datastore;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1" value="PostsDB&lt;div&gt;(NoSQL DB)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="80" x="1100" y="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sLdT72pNXIufgefm2ZWe-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="confirmação" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="520" y="560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sLdT72pNXIufgefm2ZWe-15" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;labelBorderColor=none;textShadow=1;fillColor=#cce5ff;strokeColor=#36393d;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Fluxo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Usuário&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;inicia o fluxo de&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;criar um Post de texto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="460" x="160" y="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sLdT72pNXIufgefm2ZWe-16" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#cce5ff;strokeColor=#36393d;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Processo&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Passo 1: &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Quando um usuário escreve um post de texto e clica em enviar, uma requisição POST é enviada com os detalhes do post.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Passo 2:&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;O API gateway lida com essa requisição de entrada e a encaminha para o post writer service através de um load balancer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Passo 3:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;O post writer service salva o novo post no banco de dados, chamado de PostsDB.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Passo 4:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, system-ui, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;O cliente recebe a confirmação de que o post foi criado com sucesso.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="310" width="570" x="160" y="630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="AKepsDW-8kDpoW2XCkPR-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#000000;" value="&lt;b&gt;MELHORIA&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="570" x="160" y="960" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="AKepsDW-8kDpoW2XCkPR-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=default;align=left;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;MELHORIA&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Passo 5:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Assim que os posts são adicionados ao PostsDB, o post writer service também coloca esse evento — post ID e user ID — em uma fila de mensagens (message queue). Por exemplo, se o user ID for &quot;usuário A&quot; e o post ID for &quot;post A&quot;, ele adiciona &quot;post A, usuário A&quot; na fila.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; position: relative; border-color: currentcolor; border-style: none; border-width: medium; border-image: initial; padding: 14px; border-radius: 6px; overflow: auto; color: rgb(240, 246, 252); margin-bottom: 14px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.45; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code-line language-json&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; display: inline; tab-size: 4; margin: 0px; white-space: pre; word-break: normal; border: 0px; overflow: visible; overflow-wrap: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(121, 192, 255);&quot;&gt;&quot;postId&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(165, 214, 255);&quot;&gt;&quot;post_A&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(121, 192, 255);&quot;&gt;&quot;userId&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(165, 214, 255);&quot;&gt;&quot;usuario_A&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; Agora temos um novo serviço responsável por criar o newsfeed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Passo 6:&amp;nbsp; O newsfeed generator service retira (pull) esse evento da fila de mensagens para processamento&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Passo 7: O newsfeed generator service busca os dados do novo post no PostsDB, usando o postID. Agora ele tem o post completo.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Passo 8:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;O news feed generator service encontra todos os seguidores desse usuário usando o followDB. Digamos que o usuário A é seguido pelos usuários B e C — o serviço obtém essa lista (usuário B, usuário C) do followDB.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Passo 9.&lt;/span&gt; O news feed generator service adiciona esse novo post ao feed de todos os seguidores — ou seja, adiciona o post do usuário A ao newsfeed do usuário B e do usuário C. Todos os newsfeeds de todos os usuários são armazenados no feedsDB. Uma entrada nesse banco é um mapeamento de user ID para o newsfeed: por exemplo, para o usuário B, teríamos um mapeamento de &quot;usuário B&quot; para, digamos, post 1, post 2, post 3 — o newsfeed completo dele.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Passo 10 (e último).&lt;/span&gt; A mesma informação é então atualizada no feeds cache, para acesso mais rápido.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="721" width="570" x="160" y="1029" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="AKepsDW-8kDpoW2XCkPR-3" edge="1" parent="1" source="AKepsDW-8kDpoW2XCkPR-5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="AKepsDW-8kDpoW2XCkPR-6">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
