        <mxCell id="0pcuFzeHH5d8xRQ_LBkd-2" parent="01T3yLW0Rpg_HLWIMPVe-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="7. salva post" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="110" x="890" y="700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0pcuFzeHH5d8xRQ_LBkd-4" parent="01T3yLW0Rpg_HLWIMPVe-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="8. confirmacao" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="90" x="410" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9-9iUbl91cepeQ7Uhgt_-0" parent="01T3yLW0Rpg_HLWIMPVe-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Observação&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Diferente do post de texto. As imagens e vídeos são muito grandes para serem passadas pelo api gateway e pelo post writer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Dessa forma separamos em dois:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;O arquivo pesado vai direto do cliente para o object storage&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Os metadados do post (legenda, autor e a url da mídia) seguem o caminho normal da API&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Temos um serviço que gera uma pre-signed URL ao API gateway. Essa pre-signed URL permite mandar a mídia direto ao bucket&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;O que é uma pre-signed URL: é uma url com assinatura criptografada embutida. Dessa forma dando ao cliente uma permissão temporária (por exemplo 10 minutos) para gravar um arquivo no bucket&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#080808&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="570" x="860" y="1000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
